        "source_type": "text",
        "source_sentence": "Aliphatic-aromatic and oxalic-aromatic polyhydrazides which undergo dehydration at different rates had polymer melt temperatures ranging from 250 to 300°C. and inherent viscosities ranging from 0.3 to 1.5. They were soluble in dimethyl sulfoxide, a solvent from which tough films could be cast."
